* A label of the source with a dot and a size letter (Fetch.w, Fetch.b) is the label as an
* operand, not Fetch with a size (an external).
* fixed: b350815 2026-10-11 r68togas: dotted labels ending in a size letter
* expect text: 60024e71 4e714e71
 psect dot_size_label,0,0,0,0,0
 bra.s Fetch.w
 nop
Fetch.w nop
 nop
 ends
